{
  "uid": "embedded-services",
  "title": "嵌入式助手 · 服务与资源",
  "description": "宿主 Windows 与 Docker Linux 容器是不同的资源视角。",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "tags": [
    "embedded-assistant",
    "operations"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "title": "运行说明",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**SERVICES & CAPACITY**　进程、存储与依赖\n\nWindows 指标来自官方 exporter；cAdvisor 反映 Docker 的 Linux 环境。PG SELECT 1 与 exporter 采集状态分别显示，缺失指标不会显示成零。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "主机 CPU 使用率",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "metrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1-avg(rate(windows_cpu_time_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "主机 CPU 使用率",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "metrics"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "暂无采样",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
